# /pr-approved: one row per section of the skill.
setup|Run folder, this step file and the first state read
threads|Reply to and resolve every open review thread (section 1)
ci|Green checks, mergeable, ready is true (section 2)
merge|Squash merge; state is MERGED (section 3)
tasks|Check whether work is left in this worktree (section 4)
cleanup|Delete the remote branch, remove the Orca worktree (section 5)
report|Final report to the user (section 6)
